[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.1 - Critical Hotfix[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🔧 Bug Fixes[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]Fixed: Pumpkin buffs interfering with beacon effects[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Removed automatic buff removal when pumpkin helmet is taken off
[*]This was causing beacon buffs to be removed every 5 seconds
[*]Pumpkin buffs now expire naturally (15 seconds default)
[*]Glow effect still removes immediately when helmet is removed
[/LIST]

[B]Fixed: Players with Halloween disabled still receiving pumpkin buffs[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Pumpkin buff system now properly checks if player has Halloween enabled
[*]Uses [FONT=Courier New]isEligible()[/FONT] check before applying buffs
[*]Respects [FONT=Courier New]/halloween disable[/FONT] setting
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#FFD700]📝 Config Migration[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]✅ [B]Seamless update from v3.0.0[/B] - No config changes needed
[*]🔄 [B]Automatic migration from older versions[/B] with timestamped backup
[*]Backup format: [FONT=Courier New]config_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.backup.yml[/FONT]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#FFD700]⚙️ Technical Notes[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Compatible with:[/B] Minecraft 1.21.1, Spigot/Paper/Purpur
[*][B]Breaking changes:[/B] None (hotfix only)
[*][B]Config version:[/B] 3.0.1
[*][B]Recommended for:[/B] All v3.0.0 users experiencing beacon conflicts
[/LIST]

[SIZE=3][I][COLOR=#999999]This is a stability hotfix addressing community-reported issues. Update recommended for all servers using beacon effects.[/COLOR][/I][/SIZE]